Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 16:43:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] ADD Vim-style visual pane selection so v starts
 selectable text ranges

The terminal UI starts character selection immediately from the focused pane, keeps visual anchors stable while scrolling and jumping, and covers character, line, and block yanks through the UI harness and terminal UI tests.
